{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "ff55f2c6-7db3-4add-a035-9055fbcc92a0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "You've built a grayscale prototype. Now it's time to validate it with real users and refine it into a polished, high-fidelity design.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "560fa7b1-7dc2-4bb2-bda2-09407047b669",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "11d689d6-7394-4fe0-87e7-53cd7e984974",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 1,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Step 1: Get User Feedback",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "ecf3623a-35b4-473e-aa75-12cd0ae02dd2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Before investing time in visual polish, make sure your prototype actually works for users. Test with ",
          "styles": {}
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3-5 people outside your team",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — classmates from other teams, friends, or anyone in your target audience.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c7fc3592-94b2-4478-96c6-6711cb1b3aaa",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "810c8ae5-78bd-4723-a14b-8d950500deda",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 3,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "How to Run a Quick Test",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c055a4d0-91ed-4b3c-bf85-d66632aeb2b1",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Set a task, not a tour.",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Don't walk them through the app. Give them a goal: \"You want to find a study group for CS50\" or \"You're trying to book a room for tomorrow.\"",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "a6a2e7fb-9e1d-4b54-abcb-6b58bede26bf",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Watch, don't help.",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Let them struggle. Where do they tap? Where do they hesitate? What do they say out loud?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "a12b4e3b-f1ac-415d-bb11-05c819e230b2",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Ask follow-up questions.",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " \"What did you expect to happen?\" \"What was confusing?\" \"What's missing?\"",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "54728dd7-d997-49f6-8c0c-6e78fbb29862",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "1ce11b01-b05b-49ec-8455-882f54553740",
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left",
        "level": 3,
        "isToggleable": false
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What to Look For",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "10888d0f-a1c9-41be-922d-c026f3f1f68b",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Confusion points",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — Where do users pause or look lost?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "18400d1f-261d-4f55-8b74-19de076a2261",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Wrong paths",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — Did they tap something expecting a different result?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "569a830a-cd2a-4224-9e97-6cd3a1c81d91",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Missing screens",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — Did they ask \"what happens next?\" or expect something that doesn't exist?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "baa5236e-4d2d-4b15-9310-ad6312b92ac5",
      "type": "bulletListItem",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Language issues",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " — Did they understand your labels and buttons?",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
    {
      "id": "201d88cc-de5e-4b69-a936-db8186785bc1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {
        "backgroundColor": "default",
        "textColor": "default",
        "textAlignment": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Document your feedback.",
          "styles": {
            "bold": true
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " Create a \"User Feedback\" page in your Figma file. Note what you observed, what users said, and what you plan to change.",
          "styles": {}
        }
      ],
      "children": []
    },
